  "notes": {
    "longRules": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "maxH": 900,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Long content rules\n\nInput limits (server-enforced, maxlength in forms):\n• Person name 40 chars · group name 60 · wishes 600 · rule reason 24\n\nOne-line UI (people list, rules, chips, header, selects):\n• Single line, ellipsis, full text in a tooltip (title)\n• Badges and buttons never shrink; the name gives way first\n\nHeadings (group name, “You’re in the hat, …”):\n• Wrap freely, break long unspaced words. The 60-char limit keeps it to 3 lines max.\n\nGift tag name:\n• ≤14 chars: full name at display size\n• Longer: first name big, full name small underneath\n• Size steps down with length (132 → 72px desktop, 96 → 48px mobile)\n\nWishes on the gift tag:\n• ≤90 chars: handwritten, large\n• 91–240: handwritten, smaller\n• >240: switches to body text, keeps line breaks, shows 6 lines with a fade + “Show all wishes” (expands in place, page scrolls)\n• Long links break anywhere so they never push the tag wider\n\nInitials: first + last word, skipping Jr/Sr/II/III.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 3660,
      "y": 5970
    },
